  "description": "A towering gestalt of corpses moving as one, with torso-sized limbs and fists as large as a grown halfling.",
  "features": [
    {
      "name": "Destructible",
      "kind": "Passive",
      "rulesText": "When the Zombie takes Major or greater damage, they mark an additional HP."
    },
    {
      "name": "Flailing Limbs",
      "kind": "Passive",
      "rulesText": "When the Zombie makes a standard attack, they can attack all targets within Very Close range."
    },
    {
      "name": "Another for the Pile",
      "kind": "Action",
      "rulesText": "When the Zombie is within Very Close range of a corpse, they can incorporate it into themselves, clearing a HP and a Stress."
    },
    {
      "name": "Tormented Screams",
      "kind": "Action",
      "rulesText": "Mark a Stress to cause all PCs within Far range to make a Presence Reaction Roll (13). Targets who fail lose a Hope and you gain a Fear for each. Targets who succeed must mark a Stress."
    }
